		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A brass bull the size of a castle, sent as divine punishment. Unstoppable, endlessly ravenous.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 17, <strong>HP</strong> 60, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 gore (near) +10 (5d6 + toss) or 2 gizzard stone (far) +10 (3d10) and 1 roar, <strong>MV</strong> far (burrow), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Divine</strong>. Immune to damage from non-magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Roar</strong>. All creatures who can hear within far CHA 18+ or paralyzed 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Toss</strong>. DEX 18+ or thrown 1d100 feet in a random direction.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
